        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>DoralLock TK3381, Egg Knob Trim Kit for Handlesets</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nClassically styled, the simplicity of DoralLock's Egg Knob will enhance the beauty of your home no matter if your home is styled contemporarily or traditionally. The Egg Knob Inside Trim Kit used with the DoralLock <a href=\"/products/hanover-single-cylinder-handleset-dorallock-803871b\">Hanover Handleset</a> and the <a href=\"/products/single-cylinder-montego-handleset-dorallock-810871\">Montego Handleset</a>. This is an replacement inside handle kit for these handelsets only as it is just the lever and rosette. Available in 7 finishes.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nClick here or a complete <a href=\"/products/egg-knob-dorallock-3380\">Egg Knob Set</a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the DoralLock TK3381 Egg Knob Trim Kit:\r\n<li>Knob Width: 1-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 2-5/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Rose Diameter: 2-5/8\"</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/DOR-TK3381-specifications.pdf?v=1704262207\" target=\"new\"><b>DoralLock TK3381 Egg Trim Kit (PDF)</b></a>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>",
